# Local Go workspace (machine-specific absolute paths; CI uses go mod edit -replace)
go.work
go.work.sum

# Per-session artifacts the coding-CLI adapters project into an agent's working
# directory and delete again at session cleanup (they carry an
# "orchestrator-generated / auto-removed at session cleanup" header). They only
# survive a run that was killed before cleanup, and they should never appear in
# the repo at all — a run that writes them HERE means something passed the wrong
# working directory (see enginedetect.Chat, where codex-cli used to drop it).
# Ignored as a backstop so a regression can't commit them; if you ever want a
# real, hand-written AGENTS.md tracked, force-add it and narrow this line.
AGENTS.md
.codex/
.local/
transcript.txt

# Generated private Playwright fixture distributions
/agent_go/packages/
